# Retro Party has no root-level .env — each workspace has its own:
#
#   server/.env   (copy from server/.env.example)   — SERVER_PORT, CLIENT_ORIGIN, OPENAI_API_KEY
#   client/.env   (copy from client/.env.example)    — VITE_SOCKET_URL
#
# There is no database and no Supabase configuration: rooms and games live
# entirely in the server's memory and are discarded when a room ends or
# expires, so there is nothing to persist and nothing to configure there.
